{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of &quot;Cheap Car Repair&quot;! Go back in time to the Poland of the 1990s and step into the shoes of a mechanic who runs his own Cheap car repair shop in one of the many typical housing estates. Circumstances pushes you to look for savings wherever you can. Your biggest challenge will be to manage the workshop in such a way that you not only make money, but also don't bring in angry customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have to be clever, demonstrate your knowledge of mechanics and constantly balance costs with the quality of the service you provide. Will mixing gasoline with water, using the cheapest substitutes, or maybe painting over rust with regular paint for a quick fix be enough? Remember that every decision will have consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904040/extras/e647e9e79d78f98631bedadf8040d4d7.poster.avif?t=1770630729\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904040/extras/e647e9e79d78f98631bedadf8040d4d7.webm?t=1770630729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go deeper into the world of &quot;Cheap Car Repair&quot; and feel the atmosphere of Poland in the 90s, where resourcefulness and ingenuity are the everyday life of every workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904040/extras/373fc8c763e77b72c206cfab791e0211.poster.avif?t=1770630729\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904040/extras/373fc8c763e77b72c206cfab791e0211.webm?t=1770630729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Cheap Car Repair&quot; you have full freedom in making decisions while running your workshop. Will you opt for risky tricks to save on parts, or will you bet on honesty, even if it means making less money? Every choice matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904040/extras/0716f4009e243c83a3f87dd34585b479.poster.avif?t=1770630729\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904040/extras/0716f4009e243c83a3f87dd34585b479.webm?t=1770630729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a variety of orders - from simple oil changes to complex engine repairs. Each customer brings a new challenge and story, requiring you to be both creative and mechanically knowledgeable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904040/extras/f853a2b5f547a6ce1df557143231f6ad.poster.avif?t=1770630729\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904040/extras/f853a2b5f547a6ce1df557143231f6ad.webm?t=1770630729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2904040?t=1770630729","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2904040?t=1770630729","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item